 "about_text": "Fernberger is a Los Angeles gallery founded by Emma Fernberger in January 2024. Located on North Western Avenue, it presents an intergenerational program of artists with a global outlook, placing particular emphasis on women-identifying practitioners. The program is unified by a sense of intensity and immediacy, favoring work that produces an instant visceral reaction while remaining thoughtful and historically grounded. Fernberger has described an interest in art's transformative and unifying potential, seeking pieces that are high-impact yet cerebral. The gallery has participated in major art fairs and been the subject of coverage in international publications, reflecting a growing profile within the Los Angeles gallery scene, particularly around the Melrose Hill area.",
